    <title>Efficient Fallback Chains for Multi-Tier LLM Extraction Pipelines</title>
    <summary>We present a study of fallback chain architectures for robust
structured-data extraction using large language models, evaluating
latency and cost tradeoffs across primary and secondary model tiers
under rate-limited conditions. Code available at
https://github.com/example-org/llm-fallback-bench.</summary>
