    <title>Deterministic Entity Resolution at Scale Without Learned Models</title>
    <summary>We show that a three-stage deterministic pipeline (exact,
normalized, bounded fuzzy match) matches learned entity-resolution
approaches on canonicalization benchmarks while remaining fully
auditable, with no associated code repository.</summary>
